<title>LATVIA: VITRANSAUTO Q1 LOSS 24,022 LATS.</title>
<headline>VITRANSAUTO Q1 LOSS 24,022 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vitransauto reported a first quarter loss of 24,022 lats on turnover of 882,791 lats, the stock exchange said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Vitransauto's production costs reached 864,009 lats and administrative costs were 20,844 lats, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company reported other operational income of 39,071 lats and made interest payments worth 58,133 lats.</p>
<p>Virtransauto's loss before extraordinary items and taxes was 20,976 lats.</p>
<p>Its balance sheet total after the first quarter of 1997 was 2.44 million lats and showed payments due worth 692,157 lats and debts of 1.14 million lats, the bourse said.</p>
<p>Its own capital is 1.26 million lats.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
